MIZU TORU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YABU MASATO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOBAYASHI, MASATO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOJIMA, KATSUNORI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SHIBATA, YOUZOU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TANIMIZU, TORU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YABU, MASATO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A vacuum switch comprises a breaker housed in a first grounded vacuum container (1), an isolating switch (40) and a grounding device (30) housed in a second grounded vacuum container (2), and an insulating spacer (8) which connects the first vacuum container (1) and the second vacuum container (2) in electrically insulating manner.  The breaker, the isolating switch, and a movable blade and an operation rod extended from the grounding device are arranged substantially in the same direction.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un interrupteur à vide qui comprend un coupe-circuit logé dans un premier étui à vide (1) mis à la terre, un sectionneur (40) et un dispositif de mise à la masse (30) logés dans un deuxième étui à vide (2) mis à la terre, et un écarteur isolant (8) qui établit une connexion électrique isolante entre le premier étui à vide (1) et le deuxième étui à vide (2). Le coupe-circuit, le sectionneur, une lame mobile, et une tige d'exploitation prolongeant le dispositif de mise à la masse sont orientés sensiblement dans le même sens.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>